WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:02.929
- [Female] Pull your shoulder
blades back together.

00:00:02.929 --> 00:00:04.012
There you go.

00:00:07.809 --> 00:00:09.309
- Okay, three more.

00:00:15.099 --> 00:00:16.849
- [Female] Okay, good.

00:00:51.367 --> 00:00:53.235
- Wade and I have been
friends here at the gym,

00:00:53.235 --> 00:00:56.030
I'm his personal trainer.

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:59.786
And he approached me
with a very serious tone,

00:00:59.786 --> 00:01:03.953
and he told me that he wants
to do a bodybuilding show.

00:01:11.636 --> 00:01:13.799
- [Tina] In the beginning
he didn't have the control

00:01:13.799 --> 00:01:16.141
to get on a machine and
just work the body parts

00:01:16.141 --> 00:01:17.667
that we were intending to work.

00:01:17.667 --> 00:01:20.592
His hands and his feet
need to be stabilized.

00:01:20.592 --> 00:01:21.425
You in?

00:01:21.425 --> 00:01:22.258
- Yeah.

00:01:22.258 --> 00:01:23.091
- All right.

00:01:23.091 --> 00:01:26.436
So I got very creative
and I built up apparatus'

00:01:26.436 --> 00:01:28.828
that would fit him in order
for him to secure himself

00:01:28.828 --> 00:01:31.019
and actually pull with the muscles

00:01:31.019 --> 00:01:33.073
that I was wanting him to do.

00:01:33.073 --> 00:01:34.185
Up, up, up, up,

00:01:34.185 --> 00:01:36.537
instead of it telling you what to do,

00:01:36.537 --> 00:01:38.306
you're telling it what to do.

00:01:38.306 --> 00:01:40.316
So let's tell it what to do again.

00:01:40.316 --> 00:01:41.149
- Okay.

00:01:41.149 --> 00:01:41.982
- Okay.

00:01:51.071 --> 00:01:51.904
- Up, wow.

00:01:55.019 --> 00:01:56.861
- It has improved a lot.

00:01:56.861 --> 00:02:00.124
The basic happiness that
comes from feeling strong

00:02:00.124 --> 00:02:04.291
and feeling able, instead
of disabled, is a big deal.

00:02:13.052 --> 00:02:15.934
- [Tina] Seeing Wade
accomplish his pro status

00:02:15.934 --> 00:02:19.503
as a bodybuilder was the
most unbelievable experience.

00:02:19.503 --> 00:02:23.208
This was something no one
ever thought could happen.

00:02:23.208 --> 00:02:26.291
And it happened, we made this happen.

